                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "上次我想到这里，\n肚子就变得饿饿的……欸？\n{A窃笑}大概这样想着，不知不觉散步太久了。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_11000123016_31745_content",
                "value": "上次我想到这里，\n肚子就变得饿饿的……欸？\n{A窃笑}大概这样想着，不知不觉散步太久了。",
                "duration": null,
